<title>MALAYSIA: Maybank 6-mth net up 39 pct.</title>
<headline>Maybank 6-mth net up 39 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 654.57    vs  469.69</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 57.2     vs   41.1</p>
<p>    Net income		1,818.96   vs     1,425.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  1,083.87   vs	 796.34</p>
<p>    Minorities	    less 29.73   vs  less  21.83</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)     11.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malayan Banking Bhd is Malaysia's largest banking group.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
